# Claude Code — locally installed agent skills.
# Third-party skills fetched via `npx skills add`; they are a local authoring
# aid, not part of the site, and never ship (Vite only copies public/ into
# dist/). Kept out of git so they don't enter this public repo's history.
# Reinstall with:  npx skills@latest add <owner>/<repo> --agent claude-code
.claude/skills/
# Manifest written by the same tool (source + hashes, no skill content).
# Commit this instead if you ever want the skill set to be reproducible.
skills-lock.json

